      "content": "As an AI, I cannot definitively declare one plan objectively \"works\" because economic outcomes are rarely guaranteed. Empirical data on past policies can show effectiveness in certain scenarios, but future crises are complex. Decisions about policy credibility require weighing different economic models against current market conditions, which no single data point can resolve. Therefore, judging which plan *will* work is subjective and dependent on your economic philosophy.",
